      "created_at": "2015-03-13T21:13:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had a dream last night in which Elizabeth Berkeley’s character from the movie <span class=\"bbcode-b\">Showgirls</span> was a hero deck in Sentinels.  Her shtick was every now and then pulling out Dancer targets from her deck which act as additional character cards like the Sentinels but which reduce her individual strength while in play, and which she can sacrifice to bump her stats by playing “Push Her Down the Stairs.”  Clearly I have this card game on my brain and need to give it a rest.</p>\n<p>(The really messed-up part is, if you ignore all the reasons why it’s horrible, I think that would actually be an interesting basis for a deck.)</p>",
